  * data/frames/*.labels/ — the pixel-level annotations, licensed
    CC BY-SA 4.0 <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/>.

If you redistribute this repository or anything derived from it, keep
data/credits.txt intact. If you publish results or figures, cite the dataset
(see the Citation section of README.md).

